        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "The demand for snow and ice removal equipment can be influenced by general economic conditions in the regions in which we operate, as well as local economic conditions in the regions where we sell those products, predominantly snow-belt regions in North America and Europe.",
